{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0009","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:22:45.775577Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0009"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0009","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Providing Suggestions","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Question","Reflection of feelings","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"Weak turns were 2, which introduced crisis resources before establishing their relevance; 6, which prematurely proposed alternatives and bundled questions; 8, which again bundled questions; and 12, whose assertion that nobody is irreplaceable risked reinforcing the person's central fear rather than exploring it.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0012","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:22:56.036746Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0012"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0012","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"Turn 6 moved prematurely into a writing exercise and repeated an already-answered question, while turn 10 mostly recycled earlier validation rather than deepening understanding, although turn 8 appropriately respected the user's rejection of the exercise.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0014","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:23:10.255076Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0014"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0014","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"Turn 6 moved too quickly from the person's overwhelm into a landlord call and prioritizing another bill without checking readiness, though turn 8 appropriately backed off when they objected.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0017","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:23:23.087785Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0017"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0017","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"The helper usefully addressed the fear of being judged by the advisor, but turn 6 assumed postponing brought relief without checking, and turn 8 left its practical email suggestion unfinished.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0018","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:23:32.508957Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0018"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0018","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions","Question","Question"],"note":"Turn 8 offered clothing advice before exploring what changing clothes meant to her, and turn 12 abruptly introduced self-harm screening without a disclosed safety concern, shifting away from her fear of losing her identity and her boyfriend’s affection.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0022","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:23:48.034297Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0022"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0022","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 12 weakens empathy and relevance by redirecting the user's renewed grief toward the already-agreed text to their sister before exploring what they miss about their former partner.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0023","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:23:57.270955Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0023"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0023","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 4 moves into a study task before understanding why starting feels impossible and stacks multiple questions, although the helper subsequently adapts well to the user's fear and limited capacity.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
