{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0054","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:24:40.816826Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0054"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0054","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Despite sensitive, nonblaming responses to the assault disclosure, turn 4 stacks two questions, and turn 10 largely repeats the person's fear and exhaustion without adding understanding.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0061","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:24:51.605479Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0061"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0061","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turns 4 and 6 moved into scripts for supporting the friend rather than exploring the person's persistent low mood, while turn 8 appropriately checked for self-harm but ended with an unfinished crisis-resource reference.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0082","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:05.649267Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0082"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0082","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 8 was the main weakness: it shifted from the person's loss of trust into generic fact-versus-fear and space-taking advice before exploring what they could no longer believe.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0093","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:17.664699Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0093"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0093","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 4 appropriately followed up on the user's wish to disappear, but its assessment-heavy response gave little attention to the expressed loneliness, stacked two questions, and ended with an unfinished resource reference.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0101","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:29.042173Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0101"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0101","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 8 offers reassurance without exploring the person's persistent fear of eating, while turn 4 recommends appropriate professional help but does not check whether the reported near-fainting poses an immediate medical risk.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0107","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:41.944476Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0107"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0107","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 8 moved past the person’s fear and exhaustion into call instructions, while turn 4 stacked questions and turns 10 and 12 relied partly on generic calming advice.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0111","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:51.444445Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0111"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0111","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":2,"emotion_after":2,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turns 6 and 12 shift from the person's embarrassment to writing techniques rather than exploring it, while turns 10 and 12 rely on generic, repeated drafting advice.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0129","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:26:04.268730Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0129"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0129","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"Turn 8 moves into suggesting a project without exploring the person's uncertainty about their tiredness, although the later shelf suggestions carefully respect that a small task cannot resolve their larger concerns.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
