{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0149","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:26:26.045046Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0149"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0149","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Question","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"The helper repeatedly shifted toward action before fully staying with the user's exhaustion: turn 6 proposed outreach, turn 8 minimized their concern about burdening their sister, and turn 12 returned to planning despite their stated wish for undemanding company.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
